# Flash dumps and packet captures are credential-bearing — the NVS partition of a
# stock device holds Wi-Fi and broker credentials in cleartext, and a capture of a
# home LAN carries public IP, DNS history and device MACs. tools/*.sh write into the
# working tree by default; nothing produced by them belongs in this repository.
vendor_firmware/
captures/
*.bin
*.pcap
*.pcapng
report.txt

.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
